      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Meadows at Dún an Rí – Phase 2\r\n\r\nDNG Begley are delighted to introduce Phase 2 – The Meadows at Dún an Rí, an exceptional collection of A0-rated contemporary homes in Athlone, Co. Westmeath. Ideally positioned in the highly sought-after Coosan area, this exciting new phase offers beautifully designed three and four-bedroom homes that combine generous living accommodation, exceptional energy efficiency and premium quality finishes.\r\n\r\nWith floor areas ranging from 107.5m² to 125.5m² and average private rear gardens ranging from 76m² to 100m², these spacious family homes have been thoughtfully designed to exceed modern living expectations. Constructed to the highest standards, each home delivers outstanding comfort, low running costs and sustainable living through the latest building technologies.\r\n\r\nPerfectly located just minutes from Athlone Town Centre, Lough Ree and the River Shannon, residents will enjoy an unrivalled lifestyle with excellent connectivity via the M6 motorway, rail and bus services, providing easy access to Dublin, Galway and beyond.\r\n\r\nThis development qualifies for both the Help to Buy Scheme and the First Home Scheme, making home ownership more accessible for eligible purchasers.\r\n\r\nDevelopment Features:\r\n-Eligible for the Help to Buy Scheme\r\n-Eligible for the First Home Scheme\r\n-A0 BER Rating for exceptional energy efficiency\r\n-Air-to-Water Heat Pump Heating System\r\n-Spacious homes ranging from 107.5m² to 125.5m²\r\n-Average private rear gardens from 76m² to 100m², depending on house type\r\n-Driveway parking for two cars*\r\n-Future-proofed for electric vehicle charging point*\r\n-Contemporary bespoke kitchens\r\n-High-quality specification throughout\r\n-Bright open-plan living spaces\r\n-Low-maintenance external finishes\r\n-Designed for modern family living\r\n\r\n*Where applicable.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Modern Living\r\n\r\nThe Meadows at Dún an Rí has been carefully designed to create stylish homes that combine comfort, practicality and timeless design. Bright, open-plan interiors maximise natural light while generous room proportions provide flexible living spaces ideal for modern family life. Every detail has been carefully considered to deliver homes that are both functional and elegant.\r\n\r\nKitchen & Dining\r\n\r\nThe spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area forms the heart of each home. Finished to an exceptional standard with contemporary bespoke kitchen cabinetry and quality fittings, these bright and versatile spaces are perfect for everyday family life, entertaining guests or simply relaxing in comfort. Large windows and carefully considered layouts create a welcoming environment that seamlessly connects indoor and outdoor living.\r\n\r\nEnergy Efficient Living\r\n\r\nEvery home at The Meadows at Dún an Rí has been designed to achieve an A0 Building Energy Rating, providing homeowners with exceptional levels of comfort and efficiency. An advanced air-to-water heat pump system, a feature not yet standard across all new housing developments, forms an integral part of each home's energy-efficient design. By harnessing renewable energy from the outside air, it delivers reliable heating and hot water while using significantly less electricity than conventional electric heating systems, helping homeowners enjoy lower energy bills and long-term savings.\r\n\r\nEach home benefits from:\r\n\r\n-Air-to-water heat pump heating system\r\n-Excellent levels of insulation\r\n-Energy-efficient construction\r\n-Lower energy bills\r\n-Reduced carbon emissions\r\n-Comfortable indoor temperatures throughout the year\r\n\r\nThe result is a home that is warmer in winter, cooler in summer and significantly more economical to run than older properties.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nThe Meadows at Dún an Rí enjoys a superb location in Coosan, Athlone, adjacent to Athlone Rugby Club and within easy reach of a wide range of amenities including SuperValu, B&Q, the Greenway, Athlone GAA Grounds, Athlone Regional Sports Centre, together with an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools.\r\n\r\nAthlone is one of Ireland's fastest-growing regional centres, offering outstanding employment opportunities across the technology, pharmaceutical and medical device sectors, together with excellent educational, sporting and cultural amenities. Its central location provides exceptional connectivity via the M6 motorway together with regular rail and bus services linking Dublin, Galway and the rest of the country.\r\n\r\nTravel Times\r\n\r\n-Athlone Train Station – 6 minutes\r\n-Athlone Town Centre – 7 minutes\r\n-Golden Island Shopping Centre – 7 minutes\r\n-Hodson Bay Hotel & Water Sports – 12 minutes\r\n-Dublin Airport – Approximately 1 hour 20 minutes\r\n-Government Schemes Available\r\n\r\nThe Meadows at Dún an Rí qualifies for both the Help to Buy Scheme and the First Home Scheme, providing eligible purchasers with valuable financial assistance towards the purchase of their new home.\r\n\r\nThese schemes can significantly reduce the upfront cost of buying, making home ownership more affordable than ever.\r\n\r\nHouse Types Available:\r\nThree Bedroom Homes\r\n\r\nValentia I – Mid Terrace\r\n€395,000\r\nAverage garden size: 76m²\r\n\r\nValentia II – End Terrace\r\n€405,000\r\nAverage garden size: 98m²\r\n\r\nValentia III – Semi-Detached\r\n€405,000\r\nAverage garden size: 83m²\r\n\r\nBlasket I – Semi-Detached\r\n€425,000\r\nAverage garden size: 100m²\r\n\r\nFour Bedroom Homes\r\n\r\nSkellig I – Semi-Detached\r\n€465,000\r\nAverage garden size: 97m²\r\n\r\nSkellig II – Semi-Detached (Side Entry)\r\n€465,000\r\nAverage garden size: 100m²\r\n\r\nRegister Your Interest\r\n\r\nCombining spacious layouts, A0-rated energy efficiency, generous private gardens, premium specifications and an exceptional location, The Meadows at Dún an Rí offers a rare opportunity to own a high-quality new home in one of Athlone's most desirable residential developments.\r\n\r\nContact DNG Begley today on (090) 649 1531 for further information or to arrange your viewing."
